  "facts": [
    "The Super Witch is a Super Troop based on the Witch. It can be unlocked by boosting the Witch when the Witch is at least level 5.",
    "Boosting the Witch requires 25,000 Dark Elixir or a Super Potion, and doing so allows the Witch to be boosted for 3 days. The level of Super Witch you obtain from the boost corresponds to the level of Witch you have.",
    "Because of the level requirement, players require Town Hall 12 in order to boost Witches into Super Witches. However, players require a level 8 Clan Castle or greater in order to get donated one, meaning that the troop is only accesible at Town Hall 12 or higher."
  ],
